# Google API key used for restaurant search (Places API New — Text Search).
# Location geocoding and autocomplete use Photon (OpenStreetMap), which is free
# and needs no key. Create a key at https://console.cloud.google.com/ and enable
# the "Places API (New)".
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your key. Without one, the app falls back
# to a bundled demo deck.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_API_KEY=
